  "notes": [
    "55 member states, including the Sahrawi Arab Democratic Republic (ESH), whose claimed territory (Western Sahara) is largely controlled and claimed by Morocco.",
    "6 members suspended from AU activities (unconstitutional changes of government) as of 2026-11-16: Mali, Sudan, Burkina Faso, Niger, Madagascar, Guinea-Bissau. Status in AU terms remains 'member' with participation suspended.",
    "Reinstated: Gabon (30 Apr 2025), Guinea (22 Jan 2026).",
    "Mali, Burkina Faso and Niger left ECOWAS (Jan 2025) to form the Alliance of Sahel States but remain (suspended) AU members.",
    "Madagascar and Guinea-Bissau: no lifting of suspension found as of Nov 2026 (AU in March 2026 urged Madagascar to respect its 24-month transition). Verify before major use; PSC decisions can change quickly."
  ]
